module

public import Mathlib.Data.Fin.VecNotation

/-!
# Explicit word lists for the remaining J₄ conjugation-image candidates

These lists define subgroups, without asserting their orders, normality,
Frattini ranks or completeness. Each integer is a bit mask for a product
of the 21 words in `Candidates.Words`, in increasing bit order.
The comments retain one-based rows of the exploratory GAP census.
See `source/generate.py` for provenance and the distinction between input
data and the two outstanding mathematical certificate obligations.
-/

